      "settings": {
        "title": "",
        "html": "<!-- Camso Track Systems Buying Guide — paste into your page/blog HTML editor -->\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Barlow+Condensed:wght@600;700;800&amp;family=Source+Sans+3:wght@400;600;700&amp;family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@500&amp;display=swap\">\n<style>\n.camso-guide, .camso-guide *{box-sizing:border-box}\n.camso-guide{--bg:#FFFFFF; --surface:#FFFFFF; --ink:#000000; --muted:rgba(0,0,0,.66); --line:rgba(0,0,0,.14);\n  --accent:#D15327; --accent-soft:rgba(209,83,39,.10); --amber:#D15327; --amber-soft:rgba(209,83,39,.12);\n  --bar:#D15327; --bar-track:rgba(0,0,0,.08);\n  --display:\"Barlow Condensed\",\"Arial Narrow\",Arial,sans-serif;\n  --body:\"Source Sans 3\",\"Segoe UI\",system-ui,sans-serif;\n  --mono:\"JetBrains Mono\",ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;}\n.camso-guide{background:#FFFFFF;color:#000000;font-family:var(--body);font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;max-width:1040px;margin:0 auto;padding:40px 20px 64px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:56px}\n.camso-guide h1, .camso-guide h2, .camso-guide h3{color:#000000;font-family:var(--display);text-wrap:balance;line-height:1.05;margin:0;letter-spacing:.01em}\n.camso-guide h1{font-size:clamp(2.6rem,6vw,4.2rem);font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase}\n.camso-guide h2{font-size:clamp(1.8rem,3.6vw,2.4rem);font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase}\n.camso-guide h3{font-size:1.6rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase}\n.camso-guide p{margin:0;max-width:65ch}\n.camso-guide .eyebrow{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.75rem;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--accent)}\n.camso-guide .muted{color:var(--muted)}\n.camso-guide .cg-section{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px}\n.camso-guide .hero{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;border-bottom:3px solid var(--ink);padding-bottom:32px}\n.camso-guide .hero p{font-size:1.15rem;color:var(--muted)}\n.camso-guide .lug{height:14px;background:repeating-linear-gradient(90deg,var(--ink) 0 22px,transparent 22px 34px);opacity:.9;border-radius:2px}\n.camso-guide .picker{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(240px,1fr));gap:14px}\n.camso-guide .pick{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;padding:18px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}\n.camso-guide .pick .if{font-size:.8rem;line-height:1.3;color:var(--muted);white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}\n.camso-guide .pick .then{font-family:var(--display);font-size:1.7rem;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--accent);line-height:1}\n.camso-guide .pick .why{font-size:.95rem}\n.camso-guide .tablewrap{overflow-x:auto;background:var(--surface)}\n.camso-guide table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;min-width:640px;font-size:.95rem}\n.camso-guide th, .camso-guide td{padding:12px 14px;text-align:left;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.35);vertical-align:top}\n.camso-guide thead th{font-family:var(--display);font-size:1.25rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.02em;background:#D15327;color:#FFFFFF;border-color:#D15327}\n.camso-guide tbody th{font-weight:600;color:var(--muted);white-space:nowrap;font-size:.88rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.05em}\n.camso-guide td{font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}\n.camso-guide .num{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.88rem}\n.camso-guide .bars{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;padding:20px}\n.camso-guide .bar{display:grid;grid-template-columns:110px 1fr 100px;gap:12px;align-items:center}\n.camso-guide .bar .name{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:1.1rem}\n.camso-guide .bar .track{height:18px;background:var(--bar-track);border-radius:3px;overflow:hidden}\n.camso-guide .bar .fill{height:100%;background:var(--bar)}\n.camso-guide .bar .val{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.72rem;white-space:nowrap;text-align:right;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}\n.camso-guide .models{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(300px,1fr));gap:16px}\n.camso-guide .model{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;padding:22px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}\n.camso-guide .model .top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n.camso-guide .tag{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.72rem;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:3px;background:var(--amber-soft);color:var(--amber);white-space:nowrap}\n.camso-guide .model ul{margin:0;padding-left:18px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px}\n.camso-guide .model .fits{font-size:.95rem;color:var(--muted)}\n.camso-guide .price{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.9rem}\n.camso-guide .know{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(260px,1fr));gap:20px 28px}\n.camso-guide .know div{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;border-top:2px solid var(--ink);padding-top:12px}\n.camso-guide .know strong{font-family:var(--display);font-size:1.3rem;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700}\n.camso-guide details{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;padding:14px 18px}\n.camso-guide details+details{margin-top:-8px}\n.camso-guide summary{cursor:pointer;font-weight:700}\n.camso-guide summary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:3px}\n.camso-guide details p{margin-top:10px}\n.camso-guide .cg-foot{font-size:.85rem;color:var(--muted);border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:16px}\n.camso-guide .cg-foot a{color:var(--accent)}\n@media (max-width:520px){\n.camso-guide{font-size:16px;padding-left:16px;padding-right:16px}\n.camso-guide .bar{grid-template-columns:78px 1fr 84px}\n}\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"camso-guide\">\n\n  <div class=\"hero\">\n    <span class=\"eyebrow\">ATV &amp; UTV Track System Buying Guide</span>\n    <h1>Which Camso track system fits your machine?</h1>\n    <p>Camso makes three main track systems for ATVs and side-by-sides. They all turn your rig into a year-round machine for snow, mud and swamp, but they're built for different vehicle sizes and workloads. Here's how they compare and how to pick the right one.</p>\n    <div class=\"lug\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"cg-section\" aria-labelledby=\"pick\">\n    <span class=\"eyebrow\">Start here</span>\n    <h2 id=\"pick\">Pick by what you ride</h2>\n    <div class=\"picker\">\n      <div class=\"pick\">\n        <span class=\"if\">ATV, 300–1000cc (best value)</span>\n        <span class=\"then\">ATV T4S</span>\n        <span class=\"why\">Camso's dedicated ATV system. Same track size as the X4S at a lower price.</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"pick\">\n        <span class=\"if\">ATV or mid-size UTV (400–700cc)</span>\n        <span class=\"then\">X4S</span>\n        <span class=\"why\">One system that fits both. Upgraded hubs and easier steering up front.</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"pick\">\n        <span class=\"if\">Full-size UTV, 400–1000cc</span>\n        <span class=\"then\">UTV 4S1</span>\n        <span class=\"why\">Bigger tracks and more float for Rangers, Defenders and work UTVs.</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"cg-section\" aria-labelledby=\"specs\">\n    <span class=\"eyebrow\">Side by side</span>\n    <h2 id=\"specs\">Specs at a glance</h2>\n    <div class=\"tablewrap\">\n      <table>\n        <thead>\n          <tr>\n<th scope=\"col\"></th>\n<th scope=\"col\">ATV T4S</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">X4S</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">UTV 4S1</th>\n</tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n          <tr>\n<th scope=\"row\">Vehicle</th>\n<td>ATV</td>\n<td>ATV + mid-size UTV</td>\n<td>Full-size UTV</td>\n</tr>\n          <tr>\n<th scope=\"row\">Engine size</th>\n<td>300–1000cc</td>\n<td>ATV 300–1000cc<br>UTV 400–700cc</td>\n<td>400–1000cc</td>\n</tr>\n          <tr>\n<th scope=\"row\">Track length (F / R)</th>\n<td class=\"num\">93.4\" / 98.5\"</td>\n<td class=\"num\">93.4\" / 98.5\"</td>\n<td class=\"num\">98.5\" / 116.7\"</td>\n</tr>\n          <tr>\n<th scope=\"row\">Track width (F / R)</th>\n<td class=\"num\">11.5\" / 12.5\"</td>\n<td class=\"num\">11.5\" / 12.5\"</td>\n<td class=\"num\">12.5\" / 14\"</td>\n</tr>\n          <tr>\n<th scope=\"row\">Lug height (F / R)</th>\n<td class=\"num\">1.125\" / 1.25\"</td>\n<td class=\"num\">1.125\" / 1.25\"</td>\n<td class=\"num\">1.125\" / 1.125\"</td>\n</tr>\n          <tr>\n<th scope=\"row\">Ground coverage</th>\n<td class=\"num\">~2,000 sq in</td>\n<td class=\"num\">~2,000 sq in</td>\n<td class=\"num\">~2,520 sq in</td>\n</tr>\n          <tr>\n<th scope=\"row\">Ground clearance gain</th>\n<td>+3\" vs. tires</td>\n<td>+3\" vs. tires</td>\n<td>+~5\" vs. tires</td>\n</tr>\n          <tr>\n<th scope=\"row\">Weight (F / R)</th>\n<td class=\"num\">71 / 83.7 lb</td>\n<td class=\"num\">72.6 / 79.4 lb</td>\n<td class=\"num\">103 / 120 lb</td>\n</tr>\n          <tr>\n<th scope=\"row\">Hubs &amp; wheels</th>\n<td>Sealed idler &amp; mid-rollers, molded-in bearings</td>\n<td>Double-bearing hubs, oil bath, bolt-on wheels</td>\n<td>Oiled 3-bearing hubs, foam-cushioned idlers</td>\n</tr>\n          <tr>\n<th scope=\"row\">Warranty</th>\n<td>2-year limited</td>\n<td>2-year limited</td>\n<td>2-year limited</td>\n</tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"cg-section\" aria-labelledby=\"float\">\n    <span class=\"eyebrow\">Flotation</span>\n    <h2 id=\"float\">Ground coverage</h2>\n    <p class=\"muted\">More rubber on the ground means lower ground pressure, so the machine stays on top of deep snow and soft mud instead of sinking in.</p>\n    <div class=\"bars\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Ground coverage: T4S 2,000, X4S 2,000, 4S1 2,520 square inches\">\n      <div class=\"bar\">\n<span class=\"name\">ATV T4S</span><span class=\"track\"><span class=\"fill\" style=\"display:block;width:79.4%\"></span></span><span class=\"val\">2,000 in²</span>\n</div>\n      <div class=\"bar\">\n<span class=\"name\">X4S</span><span class=\"track\"><span class=\"fill\" style=\"display:block;width:79.4%\"></span></span><span class=\"val\">2,000 in²</span>\n</div>\n      <div class=\"bar\">\n<span class=\"name\">UTV 4S1</span><span class=\"track\"><span class=\"fill\" style=\"display:block;width:100%\"></span></span><span class=\"val\">2,520 in²</span>\n</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"cg-section\" aria-labelledby=\"models\">\n    <span class=\"eyebrow\">The lineup</span>\n    <h2 id=\"models\">Model by model</h2>\n    <div class=\"models\">\n      <div class=\"model\">\n        <div class=\"top\">\n<h3>Camso ATV T4S</h3>\n<span class=\"tag\">Best value for ATVs</span>\n</div>\n        <p>A proven all-season ATV system for plowing, hunting, farm work and trail riding. It shares the X4S track size, so you get the same flotation for less.</p>\n        <ul>\n          <li>Flex-Track front tracks for a smoother ride</li>\n          <li>Sealed idler and mid-roller wheels that resist freezing</li>\n          <li>Steel frame that sheds snow, mud and debris</li>\n          <li>Adapted sprockets for hauling and towing power</li>\n        </ul>\n        <p class=\"fits\">Fits 300+ ATV models, including Honda Rubicon, Polaris Sportsman and Can-Am Outlander.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"model\">\n        <div class=\"top\">\n<h3>Camso X4S</h3>\n<span class=\"tag\">Most versatile</span>\n</div>\n        <p>Built for work and play on both ATVs and mid-size UTVs. It sits between the T4S and 4S1, with the same footprint as the T4S plus upgraded hubs and easier steering.</p>\n        <ul>\n          <li>Front tracks curve slightly inward for lighter steering</li>\n          <li>Double-bearing hubs in an oil bath for longer life</li>\n          <li>Bolt-on mid and idler wheels for easier maintenance</li>\n          <li>Cone dampers cut vibration</li>\n        </ul>\n        <p class=\"fits\">Fits 300+ ATVs (Yamaha Grizzly, Can-Am Outlander, Polaris Sportsman) and 80+ mid-size UTVs (Honda Pioneer, Polaris Ranger, Yamaha Viking).</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"model\">\n        <div class=\"top\">\n<h3>Camso UTV 4S1</h3>\n<span class=\"tag\">Full-size UTV workhorse</span>\n</div>\n        <p>Made for side-by-sides in tough conditions: ice fishing, swamp hunting, muddy ranch work and deep snow. About 25% more ground coverage than the X4S.</p>\n        <ul>\n          <li>Climbs 20° hills and handles 20° sidehills in deep snow</li>\n          <li>Hauls up to 1,000 lb in deep snow</li>\n          <li>Tows 2,500 lb ice shacks at up to 15 mph</li>\n          <li>Foam-cushioned idlers and rubber-mounted shafts for a softer ride</li>\n        </ul>\n        <p class=\"fits\">Fits 300+ UTV models, 400–1000cc, including Polaris Ranger, Kubota RTV-X and Can-Am Defender.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"cg-section\" aria-labelledby=\"know\">\n    <span class=\"eyebrow\">Before you buy</span>\n    <h2 id=\"know\">Good to know</h2>\n    <div class=\"know\">\n      <div>\n<strong>Check exact fitment</strong><p>Mount kits are vehicle-specific. Confirm your year, make and model before ordering, not just the engine size.</p>\n</div>\n      <div>\n<strong>Expect lower top speed</strong><p>On the T4S and X4S, Camso sizes the sprockets so you keep about 2/3 of your vehicle's original speed. Tracks trade speed for pulling power and float.</p>\n</div>\n      <div>\n<strong>More clearance</strong><p>Tracks lift the vehicle about 3\" (T4S, X4S) to 5\" (4S1) compared to stock tires, which helps in deep snow and ruts.</p>\n</div>\n      <div>\n<strong>Plan for the weight</strong><p>Systems range from about 155 lb (T4S) to about 223 lb (4S1) before the mount kit. Make sure your trailer and lift setup can handle it.</p>\n</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"cg-section\" aria-labelledby=\"faq\">\n    <span class=\"eyebrow\">Questions</span>\n    <h2 id=\"faq\">FAQ</h2>\n    <details><summary>What's the difference between the T4S and the X4S?</summary><p>They use the same track size and give the same ground coverage. The X4S adds double-bearing oil-bath hubs, bolt-on wheels, inward-curved front tracks for easier steering, and it also fits mid-size UTVs. The T4S is ATV-only and costs less.</p></details>\n    <details><summary>Can I put the X4S on my UTV?</summary><p>Yes, if it's a mid-size UTV in the 400–700cc range, such as a Honda Pioneer, Polaris Ranger or Yamaha Viking. For full-size UTVs up to 1000cc, the UTV 4S1 is the better match.</p></details>\n    <details><summary>Are these only for snow?</summary><p>No. All three are all-season systems built for snow, mud, swamp and rough ground, for both work and recreation.</p></details>\n    <details><summary>What warranty comes with Camso track systems?</summary><p>Each system has a 2-year limited warranty covering manufacturing defects in materials and workmanship.</p></details>\n  </div>\n</div>"
      }
    }
